window.products.push({"id":234066,"name":"Gusnilo Coffee Spoon Dessert Fork Dinnerware Set,Swan Base Holder with 5 Forks and 5 Spoons Metal Creative Dinnerware Set Mini Dessert Spoons Use for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zqBkcMFKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"『☕Superb and Luxurious Appearance』Exquisite tableware always boosts one's appetite, doesn't it? Elegant swan, exquisite fork, icing on the cake for delicious desserts. A cup of strong coffee with a small and cute spoon, full of aroma! Add a touch of brilliance to your afternoon tea pictures. 『🍰Lifelike Shapes』The spoon and fork are made of high-quality alloy and stainless steel, polished and polished by hand, with a smooth surface and delicate touch. They are not only tableware, but also a work of art. The elegant swans are full of beauty and are very suitable for family use, cafes, bars, dessert shops and parties. Their lifelike shapes will impress your guests! 『🍨Multifunctional Use』5 small and exquisite spoons, with an exquisite swan base holder and 5 forks, it is an ideal match for afternoon tea! It can be used to stir tea and coffee. It is very suitable for appetizers, desserts, seafood,ice cream ,etc. It can also be used as a fruit salad fork and tasting fork. You can use your imagination to use it in various creations,Enjoy dining. 『🍴Improve the Taste of Life』The whole set of tableware is exquisite, luxurious and low-key. Use it at a wedding or party to enhance the taste of the entire banquet. Not only that, who can refuse such an elegant gift? Believe it, this is definitely the best gift for holidays, birthdays, weddings or housewarming. Please check if the size of the fork and spoon meet your requirements.Please clean it regularly after used,Easy and fast to clean, just use clean water to wash.Don't clean with a hard object, avoid scratch the surface.We manufacture products with our heart. If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to send a message to the Gusnilo team. We will reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zqBkcMFKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gusnilo","source_asin":"B09ZP2XRZ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZP2XRZ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZP2XRZ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
