window.products.push({"id":234079,"name":"Love's cabin Weighted Blanket 5 lbs for Kids (36''x48'', Grey) 100% Organic Cotton Toddler Weighted Blanket with Glass Beads, Extra Soft Heavy Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tn8MO8mNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you’re unhappy with your purchase, we offer a full refund! What‘re weighted blankets? And how do they work? Weighted Blankets are exactly what they sound like — they’re heavy blankets (typically 12-18 pounds or more) filled with a material such as glass beads.Through the power of deep touch, you can get more restful sleep. Evenly-Distributed Weight Our 7-layer system is designed to comfortably surround your body and form to your shape while you sleep, the 7-layers are1,Luxury cotton fabric, super soft and smooth2, Extra microfiber fabric layer, prevents glass beads form leaking out3, Eco-friendly polyester padding, supportive, soft and breathable4, Micro glass beads, safe, non-toxic and silent 5, Eco-friendly polyester padding, supportive, soft and breathable6, Extra microfiber fabric layer, prevents glass beads form leaking out7, Luxury cotton fabric, breathable and cozy Reminder: 1.Choosing Your Blanket Weight - Use your personal preference as your best guide. Otherwise, general guidelines suggest about 10% of your body weight plus or minus a pound. 2. A weighted blanket would small than same size ordinary blanket because it is supposed to cover your body other than your bed. Please be rest assured it is correct size when you see a twin/queen weighted blanket is smaller than anticipated. It is OK when a weighted blanket can’t barely cover the mattress.3. For the first few nights, you may feel it is too heavy or too light weight. Getting used to a weighted blanket takes about 2-7 days, please bear with the heavy blanket a few more days. ✓ Click \"Add to Cart\" now and experience the Love's cabin promise: exceptional customer service and your satisfaction guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tn8MO8mNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Love's cabin","source_asin":"B07TY55DPH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TY55DPH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TY55DPH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234080,"name":"LOKO Buffet Cabinet with Storage, Kitchen Sideboard Storage Cabinet with Removable Wine Rack and Adjustable Shelves, Credenza Storage Cabinet for Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zRS6GBZlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"『Farmhouse & Industrial Style』Glad to share with you that LOKO has found two nice-looking buffet cabinets and the style is varied. The very first moment we saw the vintage and retro pieces in the factory, we just felt that we should have brought them to you earlier. You will be deeply impressed by the appearance once it is set up, especially when it is placed in your room while illuminated whether by sunlight or artificial light! 『Where could she go?』It’s needless to concern about where to position this rustic storage cabinet thanks to the removable wine rack and five cable management holes. Whether the wine rack is being placed there or not, it could be regarded as a buffet cabinet or sideboard storage cabinet in your kitchen or dining room to store kitchen essentials. On the other hand, it can be placed in the living room as a console table, a credenza, or a TV stand since the messy wires will be well managed through the reserved holes. 『A Sturdy Piece!』Frankly speaking, this buffet cabinet with storage is made of particle board and you may worry about the sturdiness of the sideboard when you know what material it is. We have tested it earnestly and the weight capacity of the tabletop reaches 220 lbs while other shelves could support items within 30 lbs respectively. It’s a sturdy piece thanks to the extra supporting board under the bottom panel. In addition, we’ve attached footpads on the four legs to keep it stay stable and protect your floor from scratching. 『Flexibility & Patience』The adjustable shelves inside the two storage cabinets make you freely place items that varied in height in it and you could even choose not to use the adjustable shelves to create relatively large storage space. The space between every two positions is 1 inch. Furthermore, you could freely put it in any room where you’d like it to be thanks to the waterproof surface that guarantees easy cleaning. As you’ve noticed that it is a large kitchen storage cabinet, which requires your patience when assembling it. However, you could follow the detailed instruction and assemble it step by step with numbered pieces. 『What LOKO Offers and Cares』LOKO always attaches great importance to the customer’s satisfaction whether towards our product or service. We promise that the buffets & sideboards are in perfect condition before we send them out. We could not control the shipping process and if you’ve received a damaged item. Please just contact us, and we’d take good care of any issue that occurred.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zRS6GBZlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOKO","source_asin":"B09TW7DZB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TW7DZB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TW7DZB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
