window.products.push({"id":234086,"name":"Cheese Board and Charcuterie Knife Set - Bamboo Modular Platter Serving Tray Extra Large Slide-Out Drawer with Cutlery 4 Stainless Steel Serving Utens","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RFFhz-WwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Cheese Board And Knife Set W/ Magnetic Band: Created with your utmost convenience in mind, this unique design Extra Large Charcuterie Board features 2 extra Serving Boards in tiers along with a Magnet-Secured Knife Set stored inside the Magnetic Slide-Out Surprise Drawer. The drawer reveals 4 Specialist Cheese Tools: A Cheddar Knife, A Hard Cheese Knife, A Cheese Fork and an Almond Knife; all held in place by a Magnetic Band. Innovative Multi-level Design Versatile Charcuterie Board:: for Cheese, Meats, Crudités, Crackers, Fresh Bread, Fruits, Nuts, Appetizers & Desserts, an all-in-one chopping block and serving platter that will become the most useful item in your kitchen! Why limit yourself to just one? This KRUFE Large Cheese Board is not too big to store and also fits well on the counter, has 1 Large Charcuterie Board for food preparation and other 2 Extra Boards for serving & displaying the meal. Sustainable Harvested Bamboo Cheese Board: This complete Cheese Cutting Board is professionally handmade with natural bamboo from sustainable bamboo forestry that is sturdy, odor-resistant and durable to last for years. It’s easy to clean and requires no maintenance. Clean your cheese board with warm water, wipe & dry with a cloth or paper towel for lasting beauty. Durable Quality Craftmanship W/ Build In Groove Rim: This ingenious high-end Charcuterie Board Large Non-Slip Grip, complete with a recessed groove on the inside perimeter to catch brine or juice run-off, will impress guests when entertaining and will take center stage at dinner get-togethers, making for a special DELUXE UPSCALE PRESENT for: wedding, birthday, housewarming, Mothers Day or holiday, this Cheese Board Set is sure to astound and delight that special someone in your life! Buy With Confidence: Krufe Cheeseboard and Knife Set comes with World Class Customer Service Support. Because we trust the quality of our products, if something EVER happens with your KRUFE Extra Large Charcuterie Board, WE WILL CHANGE IT immediately without any costs or effort from your side!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RFFhz-WwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KRUFE","source_asin":"B07YHTNG4Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YHTNG4Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YHTNG4Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
