window.products.push({"id":234096,"name":"Bell'O TP4452 Triple Play 52\" TV Stand for TVs up to 60\", Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZQ5-zqPYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Triple Play Universal Audio/Video System with Swivel TV Mounting. Bell'O TP4452 accommodates TV's up to 60” or 125lbs. Stand can hold up to 4 Audio/Video components and gives you 3 different options on how it can be set-up. Stand alone with TV on top, Stand with Swivel pole mounted TV, or Stand with wall mounted TV. Everything is included to accommodate your personal needs. Swivel mount moves Right & left for optimal viewing. Elegant Black tempered safety glass and a black powder coated, scratch resistant steel frame. Open architecture design allows for component ventilation and the built in CMS Cable Management System allows you to hide and organize your wires and interconnect cables.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZQ5-zqPYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bell'O","source_asin":"B00OD3LJPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OD3LJPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OD3LJPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
