window.products.push({"id":234150,"name":"WINLIFE Shaggy Bedding Comforter Set Faux Fur Flannel Furry Comforter Microfiber Long Hair Fluffy Plush Comforter Sets Gradient Ombre Blue Aqua Teal B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71khI+EIpaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality Material: The front of the comforter and pillowcase is made of 100 percent polyester microfiber plush shaggy , and the back is ultra soft crystal velvet fabric. Which offers the incredidly softness and durability, resistance to fade, wrinkles and pilling resistant. Also offers the best warmth and comfortable breathability. Twin Size: 1 ombre tie dye pastel shaggy faux fur comforter (with insert) 68inch X 86inch; 2 furry pillowcase 20inch X 26inch. Soft & Fluffy: 300 GSM microfiber whole piece filling. Feel the soft faux fur and fiber softness, provide super soft material, give you a feeling of comfort and warmth. Design: Gradient Ombre Multicolor Print, mottled pink purple blue min green with rainbow and aqua, luxurious bedding decoration, with a touch of gorgeousness, add a touch of graceful color to your room. It's a great gift idea for kids teens girls adults women on Birthday, Thanksgiving, Mother's day, Christmas or other occasions. Care Instruction: Machine wash cold on gentle cycle, tumble dry on low heat, and do not bleach to keep the color vibrant. Do not iron. We recommend cleaning before the first use because it reduces the product's cutting debris and is more skin friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71khI+EIpaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WINLIFE","source_asin":"B0B6BG6MX5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6BG6MX5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6BG6MX5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234151,"name":"PHF Quilt Set Lightweight King Size, 3PCS Ultra Soft Ultrasonic Bedspread, Geometric Square Pattern Coverlets for All Season, Drop Nicely Stitching Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qVIIVuEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber Stylish Pattern & Warmly Home Decor: Ultrasonic artwork with delicate square geometric pattern add elegant texture and sophistication to your bed, make this textured quilt set a luxurious decorative bedding collection, help create strong artistic atmosphere. It's modern and classic at the same time, let your bedroom warmly decorated and rejuvenated with our sophisticated coverlet set. Ultra Soft & Comfy: The shell of the coverlet is made of brushed soft microfiber fabric while the filler is made of 200GSM selected down alternative polyester filling, our premium quilt set turns out to be ultra soft smooth breathable and skin-friendly, along with proper cushion. You can sleep better and wake up feeling refreshed and energetic every day. Wrap yourself in the comfort of our soft coverlet that keeps you comfortable all year round. Exquisite Workmanship & Durable: PHF microfiber quilt cover is crafted with updated ultrasonic technology, making the bedspread more durable and neat compared with traditional stitching process. No worry about too tight seams or loose seams. Besides, high density microfiber fabric features longer durability, not easy to break down, ensure even decades use. This microfiber quilt is also stain resistant, pet hairs do not easily stick to the quilt, ensure hassle free caring and cleaning. Multi Use for All Season: Because of the moderate thickness and weight, neither too thick nor too thin, this quilt can be used as a quilt, bedspread, coverlet and blanket depending on the the weather and temperature, perfect for all seasons use. In spring or summer, this lightweight and breathable quilt provides right comfort without overheat; In fall or winter, this quilt can be used on top of comforter or blanket as an extra layer to ensure enough warmth. Machine Washable: Machine wash cold on gentle cycle with like colors. Tumble dry low. Do not bleach. No pilling, no shrink, no fade, labor tests show that the microfiber quilt set keep its shape and stay brands new after frequent wash cycles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qVIIVuEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHF","source_asin":"B0BQQHLV4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQQHLV4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQQHLV4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
