window.products.push({"id":234176,"name":"Lumbar Support Pillow for Office Chair, Cooling Memory Foam Lumbar Pillow for Back Pain Relief, Ergonomic Back Support Pillow with Dual Extension Stra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pfImRMWnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Size Supports the Entire Back: Measures 17.3\"x15.4\"(H x W). KingPavonini back support pillow for chair has increased height to support your upper back. The widen and thicken sides cover around your entire waist and lower back. The central bulge fits perfectly into the natural curve of your back, providing additional support for the spine. Ergonomically designed lumbar pillow will effectively relieve back pain and improve your sitting posture. Cooling Gel Memory Foam: The inner core of the lumbar support pillow is made of premium memory foam with gel particles, which is certified by OEKO-TEX. Ensuring comfortable and cool even with prolonged use. The temperature-sensitive sponge will naturally adjust its contour to fit your back when you lean against the lumbar pillow. High-density memory foam will never flatten after long-term use. Soft & Breathable Mesh Cover: Compared with other stiff mesh cover, the new mesh cover we choose is more soft and skin friendly. Breathable fabric that keeps your back cool and dry even in summer, which also has good elasticity and can be machine-washed without wear and deformation. Applicable to Multiple Scenarios: The back cushion has dual adjustable and non-tearing elastic straps, and comes with two extension straps so that you can fit it on any office chair, car seat, recliner, computer chair, gaming chair, wheelchair, etc. The anti-slip design on the back of the lumbar pillow will prevent it from slipping down or shifting, avoiding the trouble of repeated adjustments. Ideal Gift for Loved Ones: Multi-purpose lumbar pillow for chair is suitable for sedentary office workers, drivers, students, pregnant women, people after back surgery or in a wheelchair, which will help them achieve unprecedented comfort. It's a perfect gift for birthdays, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, and New Year's.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pfImRMWnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KingPavonini","source_asin":"B0BR3XT1R3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR3XT1R3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR3XT1R3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234177,"name":"Safari Nursery Decor Baby Room Neutral Boy Girl Kid Extra Thick Motivational Quotes Poster Animals Jungle Woodland Wall Art For Playroom Boho Decorati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GoMrVN9qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Stylish nursery decor ] These high-quality nursery decor, featuring cute woodland animal designs, are a great way to add a touch of charm and personality to your baby's nursery. They are produced using premium, extra thick matte finish photo paper, ensuring that they have a high-quality feel and appearance. The inks we use are also of the highest quality, ensuring that the colors in the prints are vibrant and long-lasting. These will look great in your child's room and will stand the test of time. [ Wall-friendly size ] These decor are produced in a convenient 8 x 10 inch size, making them easy to display on any wall in your nursery. They are also easy to frame, so you can customize the look of your prints to suit your decor. Whether you want to display them on their own or as part of a gallery wall, these prints are the perfect size for any space. [ Six adorable animal designs ] The nursery prints feature six cute and playful animal designs, including crocodile, lion, giraffe, monkey, hippopotamus, and zebra. These designs are perfect for a safari-themed nursery and will appeal to kids of all ages. Each design is carefully crafted and detailed, bringing these animals to life in your child's room. You can choose the perfect print to match your nursery's theme or mix and match different designs to create a unique and playful look. [ Gender-neutral options ] Woodland animal designs are perfect for a nature-themed nursery and will appeal to kids of all ages. Whether you're decorating a nursery for a baby boy or a baby girl, you'll find plenty of neutral options to choose from. These prints are a great way to add a touch of whimsy and charm to your child's nursery without being too gender-specific. [ Versatile display options ] These nursery prints, featuring adorable woodland animals, are not just limited to the nursery. They can be displayed in a variety of places, including the living room, bedroom, or any other room in your home. They are a great way to add a touch of whimsy and charm to any space. Whether you want to display them on their own or as part of a gallery wall, these prints are a versatile and stylish decor option. [ Ready To Frame ] The prints you have ordered are 8x10 inches in size and will be shipped to you without a frame. Finding the perfect frame to complement your prints is now a breeze, you have a wide variety of options to choose from at any nearby department store, craft store, or even on Amazon, allowing you to personalize your home with your new prints in a way that truly represents you. [ Great Gift ] Are you in search of the ideal gift for a young one in your life? Our adorable, unisex animal prints offer a fantastic introduction to first words, colors, and important values. Bring life and inspiration into your home with this collection of jungle safari animal prints. These prints make an excellent present for any animal enthusiast and each one showcases a different creature along with an uplifting quote.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GoMrVN9qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sokoro","source_asin":"B09H3BZ69S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H3BZ69S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H3BZ69S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
