window.products.push({"id":234210,"name":"CreativePF [8.511-1114mrv-b] Printed Gold Relief Mahogany Diploma Frame with Black Matting Holds 8.5x11-inch Documents with Glass and installed Wall H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PX+bJ1fHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CREATIVE PICTURE FRAMES are proudly made in the US since 1903. We are family owned and specialize in designing new and creative picture frames for business, office and home. They include manufactured eco-friendly molding, full strength glass or scratch resistant acrylic with hanging hardware. If you have any questions, please don't hesitate in contacting us. With our 100% Satisfaction guarantee you can buy with confidence knowing your new frames were built to last a lifetime. Drop us a line if you have any questions, Thank you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PX+bJ1fHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Picture Frames","source_asin":"B07V5BRYYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V5BRYYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V5BRYYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234211,"name":"Moscow Mule Solid Copper Mug - 16 oz. Straight Lip 100% Copper - With Large Comfort Grip Handle - See and Feel the Difference (Qty. 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tfS46hFCL._AC_.jpg","description":"PureMule Copper Mugs are Straight Up Copper. No Filler, No Garbage Metal. Just like when you make your own drink, you get what you want, a 16oz Mug Made of Pure Copper. We personally stand behind our mugs. In fact if we could, we would love to personally test each and every one of our mugs with a nice ice cold Moscow Mule . But, we have tested enough to know the quality is as pure as it gets and there is no better mug on the market to drink cold beverages from. When you make your next bar cocktail, be sure its in a PureMule Copper Mug .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tfS46hFCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PureMules","source_asin":"B00S8PYW44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S8PYW44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S8PYW44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234212,"name":"Rice Dispenser Container Cereal Bean Storage Bin Kitchen Organizer Flour Storage Sealed Box With Each Dispensing 150gram(1 CUPS)-12kgs 26.5 lb Capacit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Em5fZPRrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is a Rice Dispenser Many problems can be found when it comes to storing rice, some of which are: Keeping rice fresh, tidily having rice stored, storing rice in bulk, having easy access, using old rice first, keeping pests away etc. There are even more problems which can be found but with use of a simple product such as a rice dispenser all these problems can be flushed away. Rice Dispensers are small units for holding and storing rice wherever you wish to place them. Not only does it allow you to store rice, it manages your rice. They are designed to keep rice dry, fresh and insect free while giving easy access to grab 1 cup of rice with one press of a button or one pull of a drawer. Plus a major advantage with any rice dispenser unit is that you can easily top up rice without having to worry about the old rice being used first! (Major benefit compared to storing rice in a plastic container) Features: Capacity– Holds up to 26.5 pounds(1 kgs) of rice Color– Red /Transparent Dispensing Quantities–1 cup /150 grams / 5.3 oz Slim and lightweight rice dispenser which holds the capacity for just over 26.5 pounds of rice. Places nicely into any kitchen and even cupboard. Easy to view how much rice is left to know when more rice is required to be topped up.Ease of dispensing the rice makes it worthwhile as every push you know you are getting one cup of rice. Also could be use for store more dry food like flours, beans,spice, and pet foods... A multi-functional foods storage container good in your kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Em5fZPRrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"i Kito","source_asin":"B08819MQ6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08819MQ6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08819MQ6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234213,"name":"Raise Products Paper Napkin Bands Self Adhesive | Paper Napkin Rings Self-Adhering | Pre-Cut | Disposable | Safety Glue | Bond Paper | Pack of 500, 4.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31we+9Qp6rL._AC_.jpg","description":"STYLE Disposable doesn’t mean you have to sacrifice the looks of your napkin bands. Our bands come in all colors and can be used in any environment you put them in. These bands are specifically made for Cloth Napkins at Birthday Parties or Family Functions. Style may be an important factor in setting the right tone at your party or event. Our bands incorporate only solid colors which make them extremely easy to do exactly what you want with them, whether you need them to stand out or blend right in with the rest of your supplies. PRACTICAL We have made sure that our bands can function to fit any party or get together that you are planning. They come with a self-sealing glue to help ensure that your utensils won’t go anywhere until they are opened. We know that nobody wants napkin bands that will open easy, and make your table look unprofessional or unprepared. These bands have a strong bond which will seal your cutlery from dirt and dust to make sure that when you open them, your utensils are exactly the way you put them in. VERSATILE Do you think that you need a special napkin band for your event? When we started developing our napkin bands, this question hit us. This is why our napkin bands are suitable for all events such as: weddings, birthday parties, catering events, or even at your restaurant. Nobody wants to buy different bands for different events and you don’t have to. These bands also store effortlessly with their flat structure in the box, so you don’t need to take up more space than expected. ONE COMPANY, ENDLESS OPTIONS With two different sizes and almost unlimited color choices, they can handle anything that is thrown their way. There is no need to choose napkin bands that are just going to get the job done anymore when we have every option you could think of to offer. For your next event, make sure to set the mood right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31we+9Qp6rL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Raise Products","source_asin":"B083G5B65F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083G5B65F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083G5B65F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234214,"name":"60 Piece Silverware Set for 12, Terlulu Stainless Steel Flatware Set, Heavy Duty Cutlery Utensil Include Forks Knives Spoons, Mirror Polished Tablewar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jOnIvAHGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SERVICE FOR 12】60 piece Silverware set includes 12 dinner forks, 12 dinner spoons, 12 dinner knives, 12 teaspoons, 12 salad/dessert forks in normal size, perfect for most families. The silverware set is also an irreplaceable dining tool whether it is for daily use or for preparing dinners or parties. 【CLASSIC DESIGN&EXQUISITE WORKMANSHIP】The Flatware Set is our top pick because of its high-quality construction, elegant design and ergonomic handles that make each piece a pleasure to hold. Whether your style is traditional or modern, this flatware will complement your decor and never look dated thanks to its sleek, simple design and bright mirror finish. The set is perfect for family daily use, parties, family dinner, camping, hotel, restaurant, formal dinnes, etc. 【PROPER WEIGHT AND ERGONOMIC HANDLE】1.5 to 2 times the thickness of ordinary stainless steel silverware set, Solid construction and durable, Never bend in daily use. The curvature of our silver utensil set handle is designed according to the posture of the hand, and the appropriate weight and perfect balance are added to ensure maximum comfort during use that avoids you feel tired. 【HEALTHY AND PREMIUM MATERIAL】 This cutlery set for 12 is made of high quality food grade 18/0 stainless steel without any harmful substances, Rust resistance and nickel free, Healthy and durable for everyday use, Easy clean and dishwasher safe. 💖【LIFETIME SUPPORT】 We Terlulu guarantee lifetime free replacement or refund.If you have any questions about our modern silverware set, please contact us and we will solve it for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jOnIvAHGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Terlulu","source_asin":"B0B73NZD58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B73NZD58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B73NZD58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234215,"name":"Signature Design by Ashley Chime 12 Inch Medium Firm Memory Foam Mattress, CertiPUR-US Certified, California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":499.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OQw05aozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When it comes to your comfort, discover this 12-inch California king mattress. Its memory foam layer contours to your body, delivering amazing pressure relief to the body's major pressure points. This layer is supported by a thick layer of high-density support foam, which helps reduce motion transfer so you can enjoy an undisturbed night's sleep. This mattress arrives in a box for easy setup. Simply cut away the thick plastic wrap, unroll the mattress and watch it fully expand into place within minutes. Folding power base/box foundation available, sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OQw05aozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature Design by Ashley","source_asin":"B0BPBLYF85","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPBLYF85","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPBLYF85","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234216,"name":"LEESTAR Electric Lunch Box Toursion Dual Use Car/Truck and Work Portable Removable Food Heater 304 Stainless Steel Container 110V&12V Spoon Fork and C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514+lkogNqL._AC_SL1202_.jpg","description":"【Methods of use】 1.Put the cooked food or soup into the lunch-box. 2.Cover the box and lock it. 3.Open the socket plug then input the socket. 4.Turn on the power to start heating while the power light is on. PS: The heating time should be set according to quantity and temperature of dishes, also the ambient temperature. 1)In 77°F ambient temperature, the food can be heated with electricity. 2)In the lower ambient temperature or the frozen food should be increased the heating time. 3)Retire the power lines before eating. 【Cleanness and maintenance 】 1.The socket must be unplugged after using it. 2.Clean the box right after using it to avoid smelling bad. 3.Do not use the petro or corrosive liquid or hard brushes to clean it. 4.Add some water and use the soft rag to clean it. 5.If long time no use the lunch-box, please keep it in a dry and ventilated place. 6.If any problem of product arise, please do not repair it by yourself. You should contact with our Maintenance dept as soon as possible. 【Operating precautions】 1.Before using the product, check whether the rated voltage on the mark and the using voltage are the same. 2.If power lines are damaged, you should buy dedicated wires or buy those from manufacture. 3.DO not use the product near the inflammables. 4.Do not use your wet hands to pull or insert the cable plug. 5.It's dangerous and damaged to flush with water or put it into water. 6.Do not modify or dismount or repair the product without professional maintenance. 7.Do not use the product in unstable or wet place. 【Special precautions】 1.Do not high temperature sterilize with disinfecting cabinet. 2.Do not heat the product with microwave oven. 3.Do not refrigerate the product. 4.Do not turn on electric power without any food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514+lkogNqL._AC_SL1202_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEESTAR","source_asin":"B088LZT6V8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LZT6V8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LZT6V8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
