window.products.push({"id":234318,"name":"Mirro 12qt. Pressure Cooker/Canner, Aluminum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418P7-hoQUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Boil yourself a cup of water in just 90 seconds, or heat and serve water from the same cordless carafe. This ingenious kettle automatically shuts off after 10 seconds of boiling, plus will not operate without water, so it’s a safe choice for home or office; stainless steel heating element ensures fast boiling and durable performance even with frequent use. The stylish exterior features a polished stainless steel surface accented with black plastic. Capacity: 6 cups. Hinged locking lid, large spout, exterior water level indicator, insulated handle, and removable, washable filter. Stainless steel with plastic. Imported. 8-3/4H\". Amazon.com For tea, instant coffee, or hot chocolate, this cordless electric kettle brings 6 cups of water to a boil in minutes with an easy-cleaning, stainless-steel heating element. The kettle is made of stainless steel polished to a mirror finish, with matte-finish plastic accents for a contemporary look. To provide 360-degree access, the kettle fits onto the power base in any position. With indicator lights on both sides of the handle and an on/off switch integrated into the handle, it suits lefthanders and righthanders equally. For safety, the lid locks, the handle is insulated to stay cool, and the unit shuts off automatically when water boils or the kettle runs dry. Gauges show the water level inside the kettle in cups and liters. A removable, washable filter captures loose pieces of scale. The kettle stands 8 inches high on its power base, which has a cord wrap underneath to reduce counter clutter. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418P7-hoQUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mirro","source_asin":"B00006347P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006347P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006347P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
