window.products.push({"id":234324,"name":"Art Wall Apparition Gallery Wrapped Canvas Art by Marina Petro, 24 by 16-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZoC4+RoUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Marina Petro 'Apparition' gallery-wrapped canvas is a high-quality canvas print in which blessings from heaven bring you a glowing angel. A peaceful addition to any home or office. I paint what I love what inspires me. Inspiration can come from simple everyday objects, driving through the countryside or city or from my creative imagination. I love many things and seek to express the awesome beauty of this magnificent creation of Heaven and Earth through my paintings. I hope you enjoy your visit and are inspired by my artwork. .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZoC4+RoUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtWall","source_asin":"B00D7CA7I8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D7CA7I8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D7CA7I8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234325,"name":"Seres Celadon Bowl,Jade Green Porcelain Bowl,2 Colors-Plum Green&Light Green,龙泉青瓷碗(弟窑) (Light Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W5oNtj8fL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"This is Celadon Greenware - one famous traditional porcelain chinaware that is made in Longquan, a town near Hangzhou. It is a porcelain big round bowl. The Longquan celadon (龍泉青瓷) is a type of green-glazed Chinese procelain with a history of over one thousand years. All porcelain wares made of this Celadon Greenware has glossy glazed surface in beautiful green color, and they have distinctive graceful style for both everyday usage and indoor decoration. Material : Celadon Porcelain Size : 6CM high, 13CM wide Weight : About 500g Color : 2 optional colors as shown in the photos - Plum Green & Light Green Origin : Made in China Shipping : We ship parcel with e-packet in 1 business day from China, and it takes 7-15 business days to reach you. Condition : Brand New Packing : 1 PC/ OPP bag + 1 paper bag/box, Every product is carefully re-examed by us before shipping to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W5oNtj8fL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seres","source_asin":"B07WDL3RG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WDL3RG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WDL3RG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
