window.products.push({"id":234496,"name":"Deny Designs Elisabeth Fredriksson Art Deco Dream 1 Duvet Set with Two Pillow Shams, Queen/Full, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":190.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919Qb2QJZ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your duvet the makeover it deserves. The Deny duvet cover is one of the easiest ways to transform a stale bedspread into a design-forward statement piece. This ultra soft, woven duvet cover is machine washable and made from 100% polyester, featuring your favorite design on the top and a crisp white on the bottom. Comes with matching pillow sham(s), depending on size. And the best part? Every purchase pays the artist who designed it—supporting creativity worldwide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919Qb2QJZ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deny Designs","source_asin":"B084CPFF27","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084CPFF27","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084CPFF27","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234497,"name":"Bedify Bedding 100% Pure Silk Satin Sheet Set 4pcs, Silk Fitted Sheet 15\" Deep Pocket Mattress fit,Silk Flat Sheet&Silk Pillowcases Set Cool Soft Silk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":107.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TjuF0WneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality - Silk sheet set includes: 1 x silk fitted sheet ( King Size 76 x 80 x 15) , 1 x Flat Sheet ( King size 102 x 108) and 2 x silk satin pillowcases (20 x 40) Made from the finest 100% high quality satin silk, the silk fitted sheet features a secure continuous elastic edge, gripping the sheet firmly in place on the mattress, and is generously designed to accommodate mattresses up to 15 inch deep pocket. Machine wash in cold water. Tumble dry low. Do not bleach. Ultimate Sleeping Experience - Breathable and soft sleeping on Satin allows for skin to move freely, gliding across the surface and reducing visible marks upon waking. Our Slik Satin flat sheet adjusts to the individual's body temperature to keep you cool in summer and warm in winter.Unlike cotton, silk does not absorb moisture from the skin and hair, keeping your hair smooth and skin soft to prevent facial lines. The lustrous look of our silk satin sheets can elevate the style of your bedroom. Silk Sheets vs Cotton vs Linen When it comes to comfort, silk is unbeatable. The fabric is soft, light and pleasant to lie on and is kinder to sensitive skin. The slipperiness of silk puts less tension on the hair and skin when you sleep as compared to cotton and linen. Our sheets set can protect your hair from breakage and help to reduce facial and neck wrinkle. The soft and cool touch-feeling helps you to fall asleep quickly and enjoy a great sleeping environment. Kind to Skin and Hair - Contributes to the retention of beauty treatments in your skin maximizing its benefits. Satin is so gentle, it allows skin and hair to glide across the surface - protecting and hydrating skin, reducing split ends, and ensuring a longer-lasting blow out. Need more reasons to buy: Express your love this festive season to your loved ones and gift them our 100% silk satin fitted sheet set. With beautiful packaging, this is a great gift for occasions like Christmas, Thanksgiving, Valentine's Day, Mother's - Father's Day for men and women, Moms and Dads, and also makes a perfect gift for wedding, and anniversary too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TjuF0WneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bedify Bedding","source_asin":"B0BZ55BVQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ55BVQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ55BVQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
