window.products.push({"id":234583,"name":"BlessLiving Funny Space Cat Bed Set 3 Piece Astronaut Pet Bedspread Teens Kids Blue Galaxy Bedding Star Universe Duvet Cover (Twin)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ozqs9Ja8L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"BREATHABLE SOFTNESS - Softness and warmth breathable and more durable than other materials, microfibers are processed to protect against any shrinkage after washing. CAT ASTRONAUT PATTERN - This cat boldly goes where no cat has gone before. Such star, so galaxy, much kitty! PERFECT FIT - This 3 Piece Twin Duvet Cover Set Includes: One Duvet Cover 68\" x 86\", and Two Pillow Shams 20\" x 26\" each. NOTE: Set DOES NOT include any INSIDE FILLERS AND ACCESSORIES. CLEAN DESIGN - Duvet cover has nonslip corner ties and hidden zipper closure; shams are finished neat with envelope closures. WE'VE GOT YOU COVERED - \"Customers first\" will be our unchanging promise to consumers. If for any reason you decide that this duvet cover set is not for you, you are covered by our 90 day, no questions asked, money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ozqs9Ja8L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlessLiving","source_asin":"B0B8CJQSFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8CJQSFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8CJQSFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234584,"name":"Halloween Party Supplies Kit Serve 50，Halloween Witch Pumpkin Design Includes Disposable Dinner Plates, Dessert Plates and Napkins, Perfect for Hallow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IOk8+R46L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SERVE 50: Halloween pumpkin party supplies pack contains，50 pcs 9 inch large disposable paper dinner plate, 50 pcs 7 inch paper dessert plates, 50 pcs paper napkins(3 ply, 6.5”x6.5” folded) Trick or Treat PARTY SUPPLIES: This party pack is purple and orange. There are 4 creepy pumpkins tricking the witch into the poison can. Less spooky but more fun. If you're planning a kid-friendly Halloween party, this is your best choice. ECO-FRIENDLY & DURABLE PARTYWARE：Those disposable paper plates and napkins are all printed with food grade water-based inks, suitable for food contact. The plates are made of thick cardboard and film laminated to ensure its durability and hold more food. SAVE YOUR TIME: Halloween party disposable tableware set save you from the hassle of dishes-washing. Enjoy more time with your guests. This party pack contains all of your Halloween party tableware needs and is completely disposable. Great for the whole family and friends gathering for fun! It’s perfect for Halloween costume parties, Halloween-themed movie night, Halloween birthday party and etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IOk8+R46L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gatherfun","source_asin":"B0BHR5MVT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHR5MVT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHR5MVT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234585,"name":"Global Kabuto Knife Block Set, 7 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":323.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717giNbcUML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Global Knives have two most innovative features: the edge and the way they are balanced. The most important feature of any knife is its edge. The blade is made from one of the finest steels, Cromova 18 stainless steel. This special steel is ice-tempered and hardened to a Rockwell Hardness of 56-58 degrees, which remains razor-sharp longer than any other steel and resists rust, stains and corrosion. The blade edge is ground on both sides of the blade like western style blades; however the edge is ground to a straight point rather than a beveled edge which results in a razor-sharp edge that will stay sharp longer. Global’s Handle: To balance the blade, all Global knives have a unique hollow handle filled with the right amount of sand to create the perfect balance. Set Includes: 3-inch Paring Knife, 4.5-inch Utility Knife, 5-inch Chef’s Prep Knife, 5.5-inch Nakiri Vegetable Knife, 8-inch Chef’s Knife, 8.5-inch Bread Knife, 6-slot Black & Clear Acrylic Knife Block. Global knives are truly unique. Made in Japan with a lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717giNbcUML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Global","source_asin":"B077PFFTFQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077PFFTFQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077PFFTFQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
