window.products.push({"id":234646,"name":"LINJUN Heavy Duty Cotton Canvas Tote Bag (Zippered) (17\" x 15\" x 4\",hudie) …","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fthv8ezNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LINJUN sturdy canvas totes come in a set of three which include two basic and one fashionable tote. These versatile and strong canvas totes can be used for any occasion. These canvas bags are perfect for groceries, shopping, school, beaches, picnics, farmers markets and so much more. These reusable canvas bags are also amazing school bags, the 18 x 17 in dimensions make it simple and easy to hold and carry your laptop anywhere. LINJUN’s spacious 10oz sturdy 100% cotton bags can hold up to 30 pounds to accommodate a variety of uses. These canvas bags are great to keep in the trunk of your car for convenience. Knitting picture pattern will not fade.LINJUN’s fashion forward canvas shopping totes are perfect for every occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fthv8ezNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINJUN","source_asin":"B01HQLBCBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HQLBCBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HQLBCBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234647,"name":"RIYA Bladeless Neck Fan - Personal Portable Fan - 5200mAh Rechargeable Battery Operated Fan - Cooling USB Wearable Fan - Up to 20Hrs Use Time Hanging ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ZjauifSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Super Battery Life】- Built-in 5200mAh high-capacity battery, which can be used for up to 20 hours when fully charged. Bring you a longer cool experience. 【Quickly Cooling】- 360° surround air supply, the air volume is increased by 90%. Fast cooling in 3 seconds. There are 3-speeds to meet your needs. Keep you cool all summer long. 【Adjustable Gooseneck】- The neck is made of food grade silicone material, which is more comfortable to wear. It can be effectively non-slip, flexible and not easy to break, and the angle can be adjusted at will. It can also prevent neck discomfort caused by heat when the machine is used for a long time. 【Low Noise & Bladeless】- Turbine design, no fan blades supply air, no longer worry about hair getting stuck. The motor uses the noise reduction function, low noise, and it will not interfere with your ears. 【Portable & Comfortable】- Only 9.5 ounces, the personal neck fan is super light and reduces neck pressure. Hands-free headphone design, free your hands anytime, anywhere; stylish style makes you look cool. 【Type-C Charging】- Portable fan, can be easily charged by computer, adapter, power bank, laptop, etc. A full charge takes just 3 hours. 【Suitable for Any Scenes】- The hanging neck fan is ideal for outdoor activities such as personal cooling, office, patio, camping, traveling, hiking, climbing and watching sports. Hanging on the neck, suitable for hot weather, to avoid the embarrassment of sudden sweating in public places, it is a good helper for your summer. 【Warranty】- We provide high-quality after-sales guarantee, if you have any problem with the product, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ZjauifSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RIYA","source_asin":"B0B5HGFTQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5HGFTQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5HGFTQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
