window.products.push({"id":234649,"name":"Made By Humans Standing Little Guy Vase, Unique Ceramic Flower Vase Décor for Home and Office, Decorative Floral Bud Vase Accent for Elegant Table Cen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41otMcPeytL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bring Out Your Humorous Side With This Functional Conversation PieceLife gets easier and a lot more enjoyable when you sprinkle it with some humor and laughter. Which is exactly what this Little Guy Vase does. Well, besides making sure your gorgeous flowers don’t fall out of the vase, of course!It’s a perfect, fun, and unusual gift for any special occasion worth celebrating with your loved ones. And kudos to you if you decide to spread good karma with a simple “just because” gift for a supportive friend or a helpful colleague. (You totally deserve one, too!)Spice Up Your Interior Space With a Quirky Décor AccentTurn small, easy to neglect corners into stylish welcoming spaces that remind you to take a break and enjoy a few moments of tranquility. That’s what flowers are for, after all.Whether you treat this cute and hardworking guy with a few fresh stems of your favorite flowers, or you pick a couple of those fake ones, you’ll still make a strong, stylish, and modern decorative statement.Unconventional Design for Memorable First ImpressionsIf you’re looking for a great conversation piece and a subtle decoration to impress your guests with, this unique and playful vase will not disappoint. In fact, for some extra decorative pizzazz, consider putting together a simple floral arrangement using 3 or 4 of these little guys.Who We Are At Made By Humans, we design and create imaginative décor items, playful giftware, and whimsical accessories for the modern home and office. Fueled by our passion for great design, we strive for the perfect balance between form and function. With our bold yet practical products, you can express your unique personality and make a strong decorative statement every time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41otMcPeytL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Made By Humans","source_asin":"B07FXZ6QXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FXZ6QXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FXZ6QXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
