window.products.push({"id":234722,"name":"GZLIKES Laundry Bags Mesh Wash Bags for Delicates, Lingerie, Clothes, Bra, Washing Machine Large Travel Packing Laundry Bag with Zipper 2 Pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kVIqj-A9L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Mesh laundry bags work by providing a protective layer between the items contained within it and other items in the washer. The Wash Bag gives you a safe way to launder lingerie and other delicate items of clothing.The mesh laundry bags are made from breathable polyester fiber that protects the garments during the laundry process. It also features a protected zipper to prevent the clothes from falling out. It has been reinforced with a tough material for extra strength and comes with a soft and smooth interior for preventing tangling, snagging and stretching.The primary use for mesh laundry bags is to protect delicate fabrics in the wash. Placing items inside a mesh bag prevents them from getting damaged, especially if you have a mixed laundry load.Another way to use them is to separate certain articles of clothing from the rest of the laundry.You can also use laundry bags to prevent items from getting misplaced in the washer. For example, keeping socks together or to prevent mixing articles with another person’s clothing.Be sure to not overfill your bag. Garments need to be able to move around to get clean.Protect wool, delicates, embellished items, even denim and active wear from tangles and snags in the machine with our thoughtfully designed Mesh Washing Bags. These long-lasting fine-mesh bags won’t catch on the machine drum, but provide enough movement for effective cleaning. Protect your precious delicate garments and lingerie and keep them as good as new by washing them in our delicates washing bag. Simply place your items in the bag and wash in your machine as usual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kVIqj-A9L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GZLIKES","source_asin":"B07Z58KD44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z58KD44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z58KD44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
