window.products.push({"id":234775,"name":"Empire Art Direct Glass Wall Art \"Second City Abstract Chicago Skyline\" Frameless Free Floating Tempered Glass Panel Graphic Large Wall Art, 63\" x 24\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":197.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mYl0NBAaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About EAD Empire Art Direct has a long rich history of manufacturing wall art and home furnishings since 1948. At EAD, we are proud to be creating the best decorative products on the market. Our decoratives are over 1,000 designs, EAD has a variety of wall decorative for all moments in your life.FeaturesItem Name: Empire Art Direct Second City Abstract Chicago Skyline Frameless Tempered Glass Bird Wall Art, 63\" x 24\" x 0.2\", Ready to HangModel Name: Second City Abstract Chicago SkylineColor: BlueStyle: ContemporaryMeterial: Tempered GlassTechnics: Digital super high resolution HD printing is manufactured on the reverse side of the ultra white glass.Featuring Crystallus ultra white tempered glass that is designed to enhance depth and colors unlike conventional commercial glass. This frameless, free-floating, reverse printed, tempered art glass decor can be hung on any wall horizontally. Actual prints colors may be slightly different from pictures shown online due to different monitors. Packing: Packing with styrofoam in every side and protective corners in carton.Product Size & Weight: 63 in. x 24 in. x 0.2 in. & 22 lbsPackage Size & Weight: 65 in. x 27.2 in. x 2 in. & 26.9 lbsDecorationThe name of this grand piece is Second City, which is of course, one of the nicknames of Chicago. Some say the nickname comes from the fact that Chicago burned in 1871 and was rebuilt, thus the second city. Some say that because for years it was second in population to New York City. Some also say it comes from the A. J. Liebling book, Chicago: Second City. In any case, the painting is a fascinating abstract view of the Chicago skyline as viewed from Lake Michigan.About returns policy and our servicesIf you are not satisfied with our product or order wrong item, please let us know immediately, we will offer you the best services.Check out Empire Art Direct for more choices!ORDER NOW!DON'T MISS OUT, LIMITED STOCK!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mYl0NBAaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empire Art Direct","source_asin":"B00Y2KGE86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y2KGE86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y2KGE86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
