window.products.push({"id":234867,"name":"Touchstone Ivory Wall-Hanging Heated Electric Fireplace - 50-Inch Wide, Log or Crystal Flame - 1500W - White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":329.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VAVje1t0L._AC_SL1277_.jpg","description":"DESIGNED FOR ON-WALL MOUNTING: (FOR RECESSED STYLE, SEE OUR SIDELINE MODEL), This 50-inch-wide electric fireplace only weighs 46 pounds, so one person can easily hang it on the wall using the step-by-step instructions provided. Once it has been mounted to your wall, all you need to do is hang and secure your fireplace with the drywall screws. Overall dimensions: 50.4” W x 21.65” H x 5.5” D VERSATILE USE: Touchstone Ivory Electric Fireplace features two heat settings (high and low) which adds supplemental heat, coming from the top of the firebox. The heater is designed to provide additional heat, not replace a primary heat source. A five-flame brightness setting that ranges from a soft ember glow to a full blaze lets you adjust the flames depending on your desired intensity. The Onyx also can run with no heat as well. REALISTIC FIREPLACE: Amaze your guests with the lifelike flames of this electric fireplace. Its realistic flames are set in a pile of artificial logs or a crystal hearth (both included) that create the laid-back appeal of an authentic fireplace. The log set lies behind durable tempered glass with an elegant white frame. Enjoy smoke-free air in your home while staying warm on cold nights. ELEGANT HOME DÉCOR – Fill in your big blank wall with a touch of modernity and elegance. This electric fireplace will serve as functional décor in your bedroom, living room, library, or family room. It can be used at any time of the year, since it has a dual-mode feature that allows it to operate on low and high heat. Additionally, its built-in timer for auto-shutoff can be set for anywhere from 30 minutes to 7.5 hours. SAFE AND EFFICIENT TO USE: Save on natural gas and oil costs as this fireplace uses LED technology, which requires less energy to heat a room. It’s safe for children and pets, since its LED bulbs are cool to the touch and mercury-free. If mounting below a TV, allow 24” of space unless there is a mantle between the unit and TV.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VAVje1t0L._AC_SL1277_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Touchstone","source_asin":"B0713Q6VHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0713Q6VHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0713Q6VHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
