window.products.push({"id":234926,"name":"Premium Mason Jar Bottles Bathroom Accessories Set of 4 - Lotion Soap Dispenser, Toothbrush Holder(3 Slots), 2 Apothecary Jars - Rustic Farmhouse Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TnSdILJtL._AC_SL1492_.jpg","description":"Glass, Ceramic 【Mason Jar Set】The glass jar set contain 1pcs 16oz soap dispenser, 1pcs 16oz toothbrush toothpast holder and 2 pcs 8oz small jars. The smaller jars hold enough q-tips for a week or two and one of them I’m using for my cotton pads which holds approx 30-40. This set of accessories helped to organize our bathroom counter and make it much more homey. 【Cute Rustic Style】They are real glass and super cute. Durable plastic pump coupled with coated stainless steel lid preventing rust and corrosion for longevity. Cute 3 piece set each has a burlap string tied just below the removable lids, Mason jar bathroom accessories are adding a unique touch to the bathroom. Kind of gives off a cute rustic vibe. They are a perfect addition to rustic style bathroom! 【Our Advantage】The 4 jars have beautiful carved patterns, which look more beautiful and decorative than other jars without patterns. The jars for cotton swabs and cotton balls come with a lid, which is nice to keep dust off them, very hygienic. In addition, compared with others, the lids do screw on the small containers, not just sit on the top. 【Versatility】Rust proof stainless steel soap dispenser is suitable for dense conditioner, liquid soap, dish soap, lotions and more. Toothbrush holder with 3 large compartments , fit most sizes of electric toothbrushes, toothbrushes, toothpaste tubes, flossers, razors and more. These apothecary jars are an attractive way to organize Q-tips, cotton balls, cotton rounds, flossers,bandaids, hair ties, etc.(Q-tips, cotton balls not include). Even use it to store sugar in kitchen. 【The Best Choice for Gifts】exquisite glass products, suitable for various styles of decoration. Perfect for Christmas, weddings, housewarming/new home gifts, birthday gifts, Mother's Day gifts; it is also a good gift for family and friends all year round. If you receive a damaged product or have any other dissatisfaction, contact us and we will help you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TnSdILJtL._AC_SL1492_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPSKY","source_asin":"B08GX31D46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GX31D46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GX31D46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
