window.products.push({"id":234950,"name":"2023 Flying Insect Trap Plug-in Indoor，Upgrade Electric Flying Insect Trap Gnat Killer&UV Light Attractant Safety Fruit Flying Traps for Home, Mosquit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UNCJv-4VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【2023 Upgrade Flying Insect Trapc】Fly killer is a powerful tool for capturing flying insects such as mosquitoes, bugs, moths, fruit flies, gnats, and more. With its UV light technology, the trap lures insects towards it and once they reach the surrounding, they become trapped on the glue board with no chance of escape. Additionally, the trap doubles as a night light, making it a helpful sleep aid 💯【100% Safe & Hygienic】This trap contains no pesticides, insecticides and is completely odorless, so you can get rid of all bugs and flying insects without using any hazardous chemicals. It operates on low energy consumption, staying silent and safe even when running 24/7. No zapping and no high voltage electric sound, safe to use in areas with children and pets. 🌻【Easy to Install】Simply peel off the film of glue card and insert it into the trap. Plug the trap into a standard outlet in any room where you’ve seen flying insect activity and press the ON/OFF button. Package includes 4 fly traps, 24 glue boards and a user manual. Additional glue boards are available for continuous insect protection. 🍀【Powerful UV Light Catcher】 Most insects are sensitive to UV light wave in the range of 315-400nm. This indoor fly trap produces ultraviolet light with wavelength of 395nm to attract flying insects, and sticks them to the efficient adhesive board placed on the product for safe elimination. It is purely physical mosquito killing. 🔆【Smart Night Light Modes】 With the help of two led beads, the machine runs smart mode or night mode. In smart mode, the device will detect the light to turn on or off automatically. It will constantly light up in night light mode until you turn it off manually. 💗【Effective Dual Insect Trap 】The UV light attracts flying mosquitoes, bugs, moths, fruit flies, gnats, and insects to the surrounding. And then they will be stuck by the glue board without escape. Meanwhile, as an assistant to sleep, it can be used as a night light. Tips： Any problem you met, pls contact the seller via email. ✨【Multifunctional Fly Trap】Say goodbye to pesky flies and mosquitoes with fly traps for indoors! Our insect trap uses UV light to attract flies, fruit flies, mosquitoes, moths, gnats, and other flying insects. Once they are lured in, they will be stuck by the glue board and unable to escape. Plus, it doubles as a night light for a peaceful sleep. With our plug in fly trap, you can finally enjoy an insect-free home. 👍【Protect Large Rooms】 Ideal for indoor use and can cover up to 20 square meters, making it effective for large rooms or multiple rooms. To ensure the best results, we suggest closing doors and windows before using the trap, and placing it in a dark area for maximum effectiveness. Widely used in homes, hotels, restaurants, food processing plants, hospitals, and other places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UNCJv-4VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mayardfun","source_asin":"B0C68LT411","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234950","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C68LT411","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C68LT411","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
