window.products.push({"id":234953,"name":"Vinglacé Stainless Steel Stemless Wine Glass- Insulated Wine Tumbler with Glass Insert and Sip Lid, 10 oz, Sea Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H21Z4gc9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUELY DESIGNED: Specifically designed for wine connoisseurs who want their wine to stay cold and not acquire a metallic taste or smell that changes both the taste and the aroma of wine. This wine tumbler holds up to 10 ounces and has a glass insert. The exterior is made of kitchen grade stainless steel, but since it is only on the outside, your beverage will never touch metal. The stemless wine glass is also double walled and vacuum insulated to keep your beverage chilled or hot for hours ON-THE-GO CONVENIENCE: Perfect for any outdoor setting, this stainless steel wine glass makes it easy to take your favorite beverage on-the-go. Whether you’re enjoying a refreshing rosé poolside, an oaky chardonnay at an afternoon picnic, your morning coffee or cocktails aboard a yacht, this stemless wine glass provides you with lightweight portability in a stylish stemless design that you’ll be proud to show off. The wine tumbler includes a sip lid, allowing for easy transportation EASY CLEAN UP: To remove the glass insert, simply twist and pull with one hand while pulling the stainless steel base in the opposite direction with your other hand. This makes it easy to ensure cleanliness of your wine glass. The glass insert may simply be placed in your dishwasher for ultimate sanitization. To clean the stainless steel exterior, hand wash with a mild dishwashing soap. It’s that easy THE PERFECT GIFT FOR WINE LOVERS: Look no further for the perfect gift to give to your family member, friend, significant other, coworker, or acquaintance! A gift from Vinglacé lasts, and is sure to impress any gift recipient. Great for engagement parties, weddings, bridal showers, housewarmings, birthdays, or holidays. Every insulated wine glass comes in a beautiful gift box, ready for any special occasion. The wine glass is a gift that offers both practical use and an elegant design TRUST VINGLACE: Founded in 2016 in Texas, Vinglacé is a mission-driven company dedicated to providing customers with thoughtfully designed wine glasses, champagne flutes, and wine chillers to use in their daily lives. Our products can be found in over 200 retail locations across America. We are thankful for Bobby Flay, Kathie Lee, and Tiffani Thiessen, who took the time to post about their love for our wine bottle chillers and glasses. Join us and try our Vinglacé wine and drink tumblers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H21Z4gc9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vinglacé","source_asin":"B07KPNZ7BV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPNZ7BV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPNZ7BV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
