window.products.push({"id":234987,"name":"Panghuhu88 60 Ounce Ramen Bowl Set, 2 Sets (10 Pieces) Large Ceramic Bowls, Noodle Soup Bowl with Matching Spoon and Chopsticks for Pho Udon Soba, Yel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NAjfdPwxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍜 Set of 10PCS: You'll receive two sets of Panghuhu88 Ramen Bowls. Each set comes with wooden spoon, colander, chopsticks and chopstick rest. With this authentic Japanese style bowl set, you can enjoy your homemade ramen like dining in a traditional Asian restaurant. The supporting tableware is recommended to be washed by hand. 🍜 Perfect Size: The bowl has a diameter of 9 inches and a capacity of 60 ounces. The large bowl can hold a lot of soup and noodles. Ramen restaurants in Japan use 50oz+ bowls for soup and ramen to ensure that the toppings and soup are safely placed in the bowl without spilling. 🍜 Easy to Clean: Due to the perfect glaze coating, the surface of the bowls is smooth, which makes them very easy to clean and perfect for your dishwasher. Please do not use hard brushes, it will damage the coating. 🍜 Professional Ceramic Bowls: These pho bowls are made of durable ceramic, lead-free, non-toxic and resistant to debris. Suitable for microwaves, ovens, dishwashers and freezers. Compared to melamine or plastic ramen bowls, ceramic ramen bowls can keep your ramen hot for longer. The handmade glaze looks beautiful and unique and can decorate your kitchen when not in use. 🍜 Great Gift: Panghuhu88 ramen bowls can be used as a housewarming, wedding, and holiday gift. We hope that you can share happiness with your family, colleagues, and friends through our bowls. The package includes 2 * ramen bowls, 2 * spoons, 2 * chopsticks, 1 * chopstick rest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NAjfdPwxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panghuhu88","source_asin":"B08R72PXGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R72PXGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R72PXGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":234988,"name":"Crystal Multisize Thick Clear PVC Small Desk Protector Table Cover Protector 12x12 In Rectangular Plastic Night Stand Table Cover Desk Pad Mat for Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fB3i14kUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1. MATERIAL & PRACTICAL- Eco-friendly PVC material with the characteristics of Waterproof, Protect your table, desk, tablecloth and furniture tops against scratches, scuffs, stains, spillage etc. Great for dining table, wooden table, glass, marble, stainless steel top, office desk, writing desktops, coffee & end table, TV bench, dresser and chest table, night stand, countertop, hard floor etc. 2. THICK & HEAVY DUTY - Our thickness clear table cloth cover is heavy enough to stay in place.The clear table mat is recommended for kitchen and dining room table which has better heat resistant, maximum to 176°F/80°C. The clear pad is the best choice for textured table tops or on top of a tablecloth. For glass, marble or other smooth finishes, please use a tablecloth to prevent air bubbles. 3. CUT TO FIT - Our clear table cover is perfect for your kitchen, dining room table, furniture desktop, tablecloth, coffee table, office desk, writing desktops etc. They come with many different sizes and are able to cut to size. A sharp scissors, a pencil and a ruler is needed to make a perfect cut. Once you have these tools, you can customize your own rectangle tablecloth, square tablecloth or contact us for a custom cut size. 4. EASY TO CLEAN - Our waterproof clear table pad is transparent and very easy to clean. Simply wiping this vinyl table cover with a damp cloth that can get all the mess off its surface and you may be ready instantly to serve next round of guests! These plastic table covers can be used not only as rectangular tablecloth but also as desk protector or clear desk pad. 5. DURABLE- This PVC Vinyl cover is often used to enhance the appearance of a dining room and dampen the sounds of clinking flatware and scraping dinnerware. It is also a popular choice for catered events, banquets, and outdoor dining areas. The most important point is that it is very durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fB3i14kUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPLENDEFUL","source_asin":"B0BXSP9RZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-234988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXSP9RZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXSP9RZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
